  "usage_note": "In many English-speaking countries, students rarely call a teacher *Teacher*. They usually use the teacher's family name with **Mr.**, **Ms.**, or **Mrs.** (*Good morning, Ms. Lee*), or, at a college, sometimes the first name.",
